# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GSS -- what goes to GitHub
#
# ONLY the application code (App/) -- plus any tenant websites built later
# (websites/) -- is published. Everything else in this folder stays on the
# local PC: design notes, mockups, input data (business cards, flyers,
# contact lists), Claude outputs, start-up notes with passwords, and so on.
# Whitelist style: ignore everything at the top level, then allow back only
# what the running system needs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*
!/.gitignore
!/App/
!/websites/

# Inside App/: secrets, live data and local-only helpers
App/.env
App/instance/
App/venv/
App/.venv/
App/start_gss_*.bat
*.key
*.db
*.docx
*.pdf
*.lnk
*.jbf

# Python / tooling
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.idea/
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
